{
  "sequence_id": "seq_14469aeb38963085",
  "texts": [
    {
      "id": "PG1:T1",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "...this is bad."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T2",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "It looks like that person is going to follow DS. Her."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T3",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "If she foods in luring out one person in this place,"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T4",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "Then not will probably leave."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T5",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "..."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T6",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "Sassan."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T7",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "Hmm?"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T8",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "About Saiko,"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T9",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "I get the feeling"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T10",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "that you are being soft on her..."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T11",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "You got some reason for that?"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T12",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "..."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T13",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "Being soft..."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T14",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "SAIKO- chan..."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T15",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "??"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T1",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "Her mother took her and her brother"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T2",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "and left her husband's house."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T3",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "With the support of her lover, her mother started a snack bar."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T4",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "...However, it seems that she wasn't very skilled at managing it."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T5",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "Saiko-chan and her older brother"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T6",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "joined the cheap-in- tuition CCG Academy Junior School."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T7",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "Originally, since she had no intention of becoming a ghoul in- vestigator"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T8",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "She did terribly in her class- work and the Prac- Tical skills section."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T9",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "You know that, as well, right?"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T10",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "Yeah."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T11",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "She'd bring her games to lecture too."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T12",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "YONE- BAYA- SHI."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T13",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "She pissed the teacher off so much..."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T14",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "Oh. Okay. !!!"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T1",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "While she still had no intention of becoming a ghoul investigator,"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T2",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "as the time when everyone would choose their career paths approached,"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T3",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "The \"As Operation Aptitude Test\" with targeting the Juniors was enacted."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T4",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "[http://www.c.co.uk/index.php/index.php/wiki/01/01/01/01/01/01/01/01/01/01/01/01/01/01/01/01/01/01/01/01/01/"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T5",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "Among the six-six-six-six-six-six-six-six-six-six-six-six-six-six-six-six-six-six-six-six-six-six-six-six-six-six-six-six-six-six-six"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T6",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "her mother, who knew about the compensation payments,"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T7",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "It seems that the explanation of the risks involved never reached her mother's ears..."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T8",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "immediately agreed to this surgery."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T9",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "...or so I hear."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T10",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "...I have to mentor saiko- chan because of my position,"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T11",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "And of course, I plan to do that."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T12",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "BUT..."
    }
  ],
